#. ふぅ…穏やかないい天気…
msgctxt "0001 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "So, how about this weather?"
msgstr ""

#. …って、天気なんかわからねーし！
#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラ！！
msgctxt "0002 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Hah! Gotcha! We have no idea what the weather IS!"
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0003 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Genocide Jack"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…どうしよう？
#. ジェノサイダーと一緒に過ごしても…大丈夫かな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Is it really a good idea to hang out with\n"
"Genocide Jack...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あらん？　こんな殺人鬼で良ければ、
#. ヒマ潰しに付き合ってあげるわよん。
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Huh? Hey, if you don't mind hanging out with a serial\n"
"killer, I don't mind hanging out with a chump!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ジェノサイダーと一緒にヒマを潰した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Genocide Jack and I, um...killed some time together...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ジェノサイダーと少し仲良くなれた…のか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did I just get a little closer to...Genocide Jack?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Genocide Jack a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
